  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Remove the butter from the fridge (to soften for\n• the garlic bread). Finely chop the red onion, carrot\n• and celery. Pick and finely chop the rosemary\n• leaves. Finely chop the garlic. Thinly slice the kale,\n• discarding any larger pieces of stalk if you like.\n• TIP: Run your fingers down the rosemary stalk to\n• remove the leaves easily.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-d6fe7e0f.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large pot or saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive\n• oil over a medium-high heat. Cook the onion,\n• carrot, celery and a pinch of salt, stirring, until\n• tender, 5-6 minutes. Add the rosemary and\n• 1/2 the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-aab3cf16.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the diced tomatoes, the water, risoni (see\n• ingredients), vegetable stock pot and a pinch\n• of chilli flakes (if using). Stir to combine, then\n• bring to the boil. Reduce the heat to medium and\n• simmer until the soup is thickened and the risoni is\n• tender, 10 minutes.\n• TIP: Stir the soup every 3-4 minutes to mix the\n• ingredients well.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-e89273f5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the soup is simmering, cut slices into the bake-at-home ciabatta, 2cm apart, cutting almost to the base but not the whole way through. In a small bowl, combine the remaining garlic and 1/2 the butter. Season with salt and pepper. Spread the garlic butter between each slice of ciabatta. Bake on a lined oven tray until warmed through, 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-37605e73.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Stir the kale through the soup until wilted, 2 minutes. Stir through the sugar and remaining butter. Tear in the parsley leaves (reserve some for garnish!). Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-e256b795.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the Italian kale and risoni soup between bowls. Top with the grated Parmesan cheese and reserved parsley. Serve with the homemade garlic bread.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6194959a3e734728fd4e76b2/step-5f667d55.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
